# Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem credentials
# Register at: https://dataspace.copernicus.eu
#
# IMPORTANT: The old Copernicus Open Access Hub (scihub.copernicus.eu) 
# was shut down in October 2023. Use the new CDSE portal.
#
# You can use either CDSE_* or COPERNICUS_* variable names:

# New naming (recommended):
CDSE_USER=your_email@example.com
CDSE_PASSWORD=your_password

# Alternative naming (also supported):
# COPERNICUS_USER=your_email@example.com
# COPERNICUS_PASSWORD=your_password
